      "created_at": "2013-01-12T07:59:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The next damge he deals is just one single instance of damage.&nbsp; So the very first non-hero target he hits will take 10 damage, the rest will take 5, and the heroes will each take 2.</p><p>Was Legacy redirecting the damage using his Lead From the Front card?&nbsp; That only works on damage from villain targets, so he could not redirect Haka's damage.</p>",
