      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-01-12T08:10:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not familiar enough with Legacy's card to comment on that. But with regard to Haka's card, if it came up at my game, I'd rule it the same way dypaca just said -- because it says the '<em>next damage dealt</em>' it would be the next instance of damage that is increased, so reading in order of the card, it would be the first non-hero target that you target would get the bonus damage done to it, and everyone else takes standard listed damage.</p><p>(that said, i'm no expert on the game; I'm just saying what i understand and how i'd play it if it ever came up for me)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
